              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಡವರ ಮೇಲೆ ಅವಳಿಗೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಕರುಣೆ ಇದೆ. baḍavara mēle avaḷige tumbā karuṇe ide. She has great compassion for the poor."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Close to ದಯೆ, kindness; ಕರುಣೆ (karuṇe) is pity that moves you."
            }
          ]
        },
