            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನೆರೆಯವರು ನಮ್ಮ ನಷ್ಟಕ್ಕೆ ಸಹಾನುಭೂತಿ ತೋರಿಸಿದರು. nereyavaru namma naṣṭakke sahānubhūti tōrisidaru. The neighbours showed sympathy for our loss."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಹ, with + ಅನುಭೂತಿ, feeling: feeling along with someone."
            }
          ]
        },
